   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Pre-built LLM nodes\n\nThe same `@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.*` family, but without the agent loop: one model call with a baked-in prompt.\n\n- **Text Classifier** — sorts the input into categories, each category has its own output\n- **Information Extractor** — pulls a structure out of the text according to a schema\n\nThe `ai_languageModel` port is the same. One model can feed several nodes at once.",
    "height": 628,
    "width": 700,
    "color": 5
   },
